                        <h3 class="text-white">Smoke Bombs</h3>
                        <p class="text-white">Who needs fireworks for their gender reveal when it can happen in a haze of pink or blue excitement of smoke? It's like a magic trick where the smoke clears to unveil the gender secret in style.</p>
